<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', padding: 0 }}>
    <Box style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 1280, height: 10, background: '#0E3F8C' }} />

        <Box style={{ width: 1280, height: 710, flexDirection: 'row' }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 470, height: 710, background: '#0E3F8C', padding: '96px 48px', flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
                <Box>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#9DB6DC', letterSpacing: 3 }}>第四部分</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 190, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', lineHeight: 1.0, marginTop: 18 }}>04</Text>
                    <Box style={{ width: 64, height: 4, background: '#FFC107', marginTop: 26 }} />
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 14 }}>
                    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#FFC107', width: 30 }}>一</Text>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#C9D8EC' }}>预算等值线</Text>
                    </Box>
                    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#FFC107', width: 30 }}>二</Text>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#C9D8EC' }}>换算率协议</Text>
                    </Box>
                    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#FFC107', width: 30 }}>三</Text>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#C9D8EC' }}>阶段级归因</Text>
                    </Box>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#9DB6DC', lineHeight: 1.8 }}>
                    三件事，标准是同一条：别人能不能照着复算。
                    </Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFC107', marginTop: 12, letterSpacing: 1 }}>13 / 15</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ flex: 1, padding: '70px 150px 44px 72px', flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 40, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>
                        接下来要做什么
                    </Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.8, marginTop: 14 }}>
                        不是再做一个更强的策略，而是把这条路上的三个数字变成别人能复算的东西。
                    </Text>

                    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 22, marginTop: 32 }}>
                        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-start' }}>
                            <Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, background: '#1E4FA8', marginTop: 12, marginRight: 16 }} />
                            <Text style={{ flex: 1, fontSize: 20, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.65 }}>
                                固定总预算，画"取几条 × 每条多长"的等值线。
                            </Text>
                        </Box>
                        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-start' }}>
                            <Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, background: '#1E4FA8', marginTop: 12, marginRight: 16 }} />
                            <Text style={{ flex: 1, fontSize: 20, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.65 }}>
                                一条上下文演示相当于多少条训练示范——给出可复算的换算规则。
                            </Text>
                        </Box>
                        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-start' }}>
                            <Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, background: '#1E4FA8', marginTop: 12, marginRight: 16 }} />
                            <Text style={{ flex: 1, fontSize: 20, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.65 }}>
                                把"哪一步断了"变成带置信区间的估计，而不是事后人工归类。
                            </Text>
                        </Box>
                    </Box>

                    <Box style={{ marginTop: 24, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px dashed #8B97A8', padding: '14px 18px' }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
                            三条底线：等算力、等数据、检索度量固定——少一条，曲线就不可解释。
                        </Text>
                    </Box>
                </Box>

                <Box style={{ background: '#F0F5FC', padding: '16px 22px', borderLeft: '4px solid #1E4FA8' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#0E3F8C', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
                        这三件事都是零训练或低成本实验，不需要新硬件。
                    </Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>
        </Box>
    </Box>
</Slide>
